    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "Explore through <strong>Idle Campaign</strong>! A DnD-inspired idle/incremental game about slaughtering enemies with a group of heroes. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No rebirth! Continue forward without the need to rebirth and repeat the same levels.<br></li><li>Battle with three hero pieces!<br></li><li>Craft armor, upgrade the armor, and gain crafting levels.<br></li><li>Spend gold to gain upgrades in the Trainer window.<br></li><li> Spend skill points and advanced skill points to power up.<br></li><li>Unlock Specialty &amp; Ability points to increase unique ability powers for each hero piece.<br></li><li>Find Ritual Candles &amp; Magic pouches to get special bonuses through the Reliquary.<br></li><li> Trade in Ethereal Keys for Ethereal Chests to get rewards.<br></li><li> Climb the leaderboards!<br></li><li>Find collectibles to finish Tasks!<br></li><li>Explore unique zones during your campaigns. <br></li><li>Do daily quests, and claim daily login rewards.<br></li><li>Use the spinning wheel to earn fun bonuses.<br></li><li>And More!</li></ul><br>Do your hero pieces proud and see how far you can make it through your campaign!",
    "about_the_game": "Explore through <strong>Idle Campaign</strong>! A DnD-inspired idle/incremental game about slaughtering enemies with a group of heroes. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No rebirth! Continue forward without the need to rebirth and repeat the same levels.<br></li><li>Battle with three hero pieces!<br></li><li>Craft armor, upgrade the armor, and gain crafting levels.<br></li><li>Spend gold to gain upgrades in the Trainer window.<br></li><li> Spend skill points and advanced skill points to power up.<br></li><li>Unlock Specialty &amp; Ability points to increase unique ability powers for each hero piece.<br></li><li>Find Ritual Candles &amp; Magic pouches to get special bonuses through the Reliquary.<br></li><li> Trade in Ethereal Keys for Ethereal Chests to get rewards.<br></li><li> Climb the leaderboards!<br></li><li>Find collectibles to finish Tasks!<br></li><li>Explore unique zones during your campaigns. <br></li><li>Do daily quests, and claim daily login rewards.<br></li><li>Use the spinning wheel to earn fun bonuses.<br></li><li>And More!</li></ul><br>Do your hero pieces proud and see how far you can make it through your campaign!",
    "short_description": "Explore through Idle Campaign! A DnD-inspired idle/incremental game about slaughtering enemies with a group of heroes through an endless campaign!This game has no rebirth; level continuously without having to repeat levels!",
